  "zh": "# 中国苹果免费更换新机，AI安全领袖离职引发行业关注\n## AI 与科技\n- **Kolibri 开放权重模型发布**：Aleph‑Alpha 推出主权开源大模型，意味着开放生态又添重要力量，值得开发者关注。\n- **OpenAI 安全主管离职**：安全负责人公开批评内部文化破裂，凸显 AI 治理仍是行业痛点。\n- **Claude 5.5 使用技巧**：官方博客详细说明如何在 Claude 中发挥最高性能，对提升使用体验实用。\n## 产业与市场\n- **苹果免费更换受影响设备**：苹果针对部分硬件问题承诺免费更换新机，提升用户信任并减少售后纠纷。\n- **服务区闪充变慢充车企回应**：新能源车充电速度下降引发车企集中解释，关系日常出行体验与充电基础设施建设。\n- **全球债市拉响警报**：债券市场波动加剧暗示宏观经济风险上升，投资者需关注潜在系统性风险。\n## 国际视野\n- **中方回应喀秋莎租借延长**：外交部就军事装备租赁问题表态，透露地区安全合作的最新动态。\n- **系外行星无线电信号首次捕获**：科学家首次探测到系外行星的无线电爆发，为寻找外星生命提供新线索。",
  "en": "# Apple offers free replacements, OpenAI safety chief quits, and Kolibri releases open-weight model – key tech moves today.\n## AI & Tech\n- **Kolibri open-weight model release**：Aleph‑Alpha sovereign open-weight model adds a major player to the open AI ecosystem, worth watching by developers.\n- **OpenAI chief quits**：OpenAI chief resignation and public criticism reveal deep cultural issues at OpenAI, highlighting AI governance challenges.\n- **Claude 5.5 tips**：Official guide shows how to get the most out of Claude Opus 5.5, useful for boosting performance and productivity.\n## Industry & Market\n- **Apple free device swap**：Apple promise to replace affected devices for free strengthens brand trust and reduces after sales disputes.\n- **EV charging slowdown**：Slowing flash charge rates at service areas have prompted automakers to explain, affecting daily EV usability and charging infrastructure.\n- **Global debt alert**: Rising volatility in the global bond market signals growing macro economic risk, urging investors to monitor systemic threats.\n## Global Outlook\n- **Katusha lease reply**: China response on extending the Katusha lease sheds light on regional military cooperation and security dynamics.\n- **Radio signal from exoplanet detected**: First detection of a radio signal from an exoplanet opens a new avenue in the search for extraterrestrial intelligence."
